      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Lee%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Fort Lee became the birthplace of the American film industry, hosting early studios like Kalem and Universal's predecessor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
