      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Lee%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The George Washington Bridge, the world's busiest motor vehicle bridge, spans from Fort Lee to Manhattan.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
